[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10801.83, "timestamp": "03:00:01", "text": "それはダメージを与える。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10806.55, "timestamp": "03:00:06", "text": "それは痛い。わかった。それを適用してください。よし。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10808.469, "timestamp": "03:00:08", "text": "私の番はいつですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10810.54, "timestamp": "03:00:10", "text": "よし。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10812.309, "timestamp": "03:00:12", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10814.95, "timestamp": "03:00:14", "text": "では、私も前進していると言えるのでしょうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10818.469, "timestamp": "03:00:18", "text": "はい。持続する。ええと、10フィート。では、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10820.469, "timestamp": "03:00:20", "text": "ここ。さぁ行こう。あなたが望まない限り"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10821.91, "timestamp": "03:00:21", "text": "抵抗する。抵抗したいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10824.389, "timestamp": "03:00:24", "text": "いや、いや、いや。私は抵抗しません。私は私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10824.63, "timestamp": "03:00:24", "text": "うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10825.83, "timestamp": "03:00:25", "text": "まあ、前に進むしかないかな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10827.269, "timestamp": "03:00:27", "text": "また、こちらでは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10829.51, "timestamp": "03:00:29", "text": "こちらの方は非常に薄いように見えます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10832.55, "timestamp": "03:00:32", "text": "膜。こちらのセクションは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10835.51, "timestamp": "03:00:35", "text": "非常に薄い膜。攻撃すれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10838.63, "timestamp": "03:00:38", "text": "おそらく壊れるでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10840.55, "timestamp": "03:00:40", "text": "もちろん、いいですよ。攻撃しよう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10842.23, "timestamp": "03:00:42", "text": "しかし、それは攻撃を意味するだろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10843.51, "timestamp": "03:00:43", "text": "複数回攻撃するんだよね？もし私がそうでないなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10843.99, "timestamp": "03:00:43", "text": "間違いです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10845.03, "timestamp": "03:00:45", "text": "ええ、私は複数回攻撃します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10846.63, "timestamp": "03:00:46", "text": "うん。うん。よし。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10848.95, "timestamp": "03:00:48", "text": "だから、私はプールを攻撃する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10851.83, "timestamp": "03:00:51", "text": "よし。すぐにダメージを与えてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10852.95, "timestamp": "03:00:52", "text": "ああ、すぐにダメージを受けた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10855.03, "timestamp": "03:00:55", "text": "うん。うん。だって、ただの壁だから。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10857.19, "timestamp": "03:00:57", "text": "うん。完全な損傷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10859.83, "timestamp": "03:00:59", "text": "ダメージ。"}]